  m_Name: WyrArmHead
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.Dilemma
  _id: wyr_arm_head
  _verb: 0
  _weight: 0
  _narratorPrompt: 'One free upgrade to the body, permanent, no refunds. Would you
    rather grow a fully working [amber]third arm[/amber], or a second, fully awake
    [amber]head[/amber] that thinks its own thoughts and shares your neck. Choose your
    new self.'
  _choices:
  - _id: third_arm
    _label: A third arm
    _narratorReact: The third arm. Practical. You want to do more, hold more, reach
      further, and you would bolt an extra limb on without a second thought. A doer.
      Terrifying at dinner parties, but a doer.
    _narratorReactStruck:
    _struckParty:
    _gambledParty:
    _route: straight
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 69
    _endsGame: 0
    _profileImpact: []
  - _id: second_head
    _label: A second head
    _narratorReact: The second head. Bold. You would rather never be alone with your
      thoughts again, even if the company is another you with opinions. Some people
      cannot bear the quiet in their own skull. Now you never would.
    _narratorReactStruck:
    _struckParty:
    _gambledParty:
    _route: straight
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 31
    _endsGame: 0
    _profileImpact: []
  _figuresBranded: 0
  _statsHeading: how others chose
  _roomBlueFraction: 0.43
  _crowdThreshold: 0.5
  _thresholdLabel: the line
